          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Indent Tab: When I despair, I remember that all through history the way of truth and love have always won. There have been tyrants and murderers, and for a time, they can seem invincible, but in the end, they always fall. Think of it--always.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "underline": false,
